  m_text: "Roles are customizable! Game hosts can choose how many times an Engineer can vent, Shapeshifter cooldown, etc. They can also pick the percentage chance of one of these roles occurring in the game. You can always see if a role is turned on in the game lobby settings!\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 305035efd68b5d146a985bddbd1d06c9, type: 2}
